stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Created
  Created --> GatheringEvidence: durable checkpoint
  GatheringEvidence --> EvaluatingEvidence: Phase 3 retrieval
  EvaluatingEvidence --> Failed: provenance or node failure
  EvaluatingEvidence --> DeterminingReview: citations validated
  DeterminingReview --> AwaitingHumanReview: mandatory trigger
  DeterminingReview --> Completed: nonconsequential artifact
  AwaitingHumanReview --> Completed: authorized artifact action
  AwaitingHumanReview --> AwaitingAdditionalInformation: request or return
  AwaitingHumanReview --> Cancelled: authorized cancel
  AwaitingAdditionalInformation --> GatheringEvidence: bounded retry
  Failed --> GatheringEvidence: bounded retry
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
